#: ../../source/export.rst:2 e04d780ac85246308b2b1fac3c843a77
msgid "_`food_volume_measure usage demonstration`"
msgstr "food_volume_measure 使用演示"

#: ../../source/export.rst:4 ad259679c05b48abafc4371510adde92
msgid ""
"Brief overview: the library :code:`food_volume_measure` measures food "
"volume on oven trays from a fixed depth camera, using the PCD-IM "
"(baseline-plane height-difference integral) method."
msgstr "简要概述：:code:`food_volume_measure` 库使用固定深度相机，通过 PCD-IM（基准面高度差积分）方法测量烤盘上的食材体积。"

#: ../../source/export.rst:9 ca52e3b291ee474796f4ac1968fca903
msgid "_`Theory`"
msgstr "原理"

#: ../../source/export.rst:11 4f2fbda47c444a93ac7a4e61e252e4a0
msgid ""
"An empty-oven baseline is first discretized into a height map on a "
"RANSAC-fitted base plane. The food point cloud is voxel-downsampled and "
"clustered in the base plane, and every grid cell keeps only the highest "
"food surface point. The volume is the per-cell height difference between "
"the food surface and the empty-oven baseline, integrated over the cell "
"area:"
msgstr ""
"首先将空炉基线离散为 RANSAC 拟合基准面上的高度图。食物点云经体素降采样后在基准面内聚类，"
"每个网格单元只保留最高的食物表面点。体积即食物表面与空炉基线之间的逐格高度差按单元面积积分："

#: ../../source/export.rst:17 c640e65485c1425c9a6b72b989b8cb9a
msgid ""
"V = \\sum_{(u,v)} \\left( h_{\\text{food}}(u,v) - "
"h_{\\text{baseline}}(u,v) \\right) \\cdot \\Delta s^2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/export.rst:22 e65a5aa0559447218bba500e3e6cc5d4
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Delta s` is the integration resolution. Missing depth "
"caused by reflections is completed conservatively inside single "
"foreground components; completed cells are counted separately from "
"measured cells."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\Delta s` 为积分分辨率。反光导致的缺失深度仅在单一前景组件内部保守补全；补全单元与实测单元分开统计。"

#: ../../source/export.rst:27 f45a840194e4417cadfec8286d907252
msgid "_`Usage demonstration`"
msgstr "使用演示"

#: ../../source/export.rst:29 50b4c7733e474676a89f6702346bf579
msgid ""
"The end-to-end :code:`FoodVolumeMeasurer` class composes the whole "
"pipeline. Set the empty-oven baseline and the food frame, optionally "
"tune parameters through chainable setters or a JSON config, then call "
":code:`run`. It returns a :code:`VolumeEstimate` with the integrated "
"volume (cm³), point counts, footprint area and coverage, mean/max "
"height, per-component breakdowns, and reference volumes (AABB, OBB, "
"convex hull)."
msgstr ""
"端到端的 :code:`FoodVolumeMeasurer` 类组合了整条流水线。设置空炉基线与食材帧，"
"可选地通过链式 setter 或 JSON 配置调节参数，然后调用 :code:`run`。"
"它返回一个 :code:`VolumeEstimate`，包含积分体积（cm³）、点数、足迹面积与覆盖率、"
"平均/最大高度、逐组件明细以及参考体积（AABB、OBB、凸包）。"

